# Checkpoints: a loss at S3 restores C2 (the report); after Brom's rest a loss restores that checkpoint (slice 3D-6: the
# village has no foe left at S3 - the Warden is the barrow's - so the losses are the barrow's: tests/barrow/routes/cp_c3.route;
# here the rest checkpoint is taken at S1 and a loss to the squad restores it).
choose 0
talk wren
expect stage=1 cp=1
talk brom
expect potions=3 talked_brom=1
choose 0
talk brom
expect cp=9 potions=3 hp=20
policy guard
chase slime_b
expect retries=1 stage=1 cp=9 potions=3 talked_brom=1 hp=20 at_cp=1 visible:slime_b=1
policy smart
chase slime_b
expect patrol_b=1
